  "comments": [
    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"IRQ handler ($fffe). Runs the raster IRQ and the CIA 1 timer A and timer B routines."},
    {"at":5,"placement":"side","text":"Calls the raster routine when the raster IRQ is enabled and flagged."},
    {"at":18,"placement":"side","text":"Reading the ICR acknowledges the CIA 1 interrupts."},
    {"at":25,"placement":"side","text":"Timer B: runs $991f, the routine for sound requests and music data."},
    {"at":33,"placement":"side","text":"Timer A: runs $9e9a. It counts down the sound timers and writes the SID."},
    {"at":49,"placement":"line","text":"NMI handler ($fffa): only RTI. Thus the RESTORE key does nothing while $01 = $25."},
    {"at":50,"placement":"line","text":"Raster IRQ at lines $72 and $fa. Line $72 sets the scene colour, line $fa updates the sprites."},
    {"at":55,"placement":"side","text":"Line $72: next IRQ at line $fa."},
    {"at":72,"placement":"side","text":"Sets the background colour of the scene from the table at $7f40."},
    {"at":81,"placement":"line","text":"Line $fa: next IRQ at line $72, black background for the top of the screen."},
    {"at":104,"placement":"side","text":"Allows other interrupts during the sprite update."},
    {"at":108,"placement":"side","text":"When sprites_frozen is not 0, the sprites do not move."}
  ],
